flowchart TD
    A([Each tick where\nposition state changes]) --> B["hedgeRpt.MaybeReport\nnetDelta · underlyingPrice\nsuggestedInstrument"]

    B --> C{First report\nor lastDelta == 0?}
    C -->|"Yes"| F[Emit report]
    C -->|"No"| D{change = abs delta - lastDelta / lastDelta\n> threshold default 5%?}
    D -->|"No"| Z([No output])
    D -->|"Yes"| E[Update lastDelta]
    E --> F

    F --> G[uncovered = abs netDelta]
    G --> H["Split 5 tranches\n5% → 0.05 × uncovered\n10% → 0.10 × uncovered\n15% → 0.15 × uncovered\n30% → 0.30 × uncovered\n40% → 0.40 × uncovered"]
    H --> I[Build Report struct\ntimestamp · price · netDelta\nuncoveredQty · tranches]
    I --> J[Write hedge_report.json\noverwrite previous]
    I --> K[slog.Info hedge_report\nto bot.log]

    L["⚠ REPORT ONLY\nBot NEVER places\nfutures orders\nAll hedging is manual"]

    style L fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,color:#000
    style Z fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#9e9e9e,color:#000
